''
'' Quarkus dark mode theme for PlantUML
'' https://quarkus.io
''
'' NOTE: puml-theme-quarkus.puml and puml-theme-quarkus-dark.puml are deliberately
'' kept as two self-contained, near-identical files. They are meant to be pulled in
'' by URL (!include https://quarkus.io/assets/plantuml/themes/...), and PlantUML
'' does not resolve a relative !include inside a remotely included file, so a
'' shared base file cannot be used. When changing structure (fonts, skinparams,
'' sprite), update both files; only the colours should differ.
''

